{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 154,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.9645385742188,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "settings, which would need to be addressed first, regardless of the type of TB test available. In",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.6265869140625,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "terms of test accessibility, the data from the DCE found that consumers had a strong preference",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.963238716125488,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9481201171875,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "for testing in the community and primary care settings, compared with hospital locations; this",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        294.1744079589844,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "finding could have health equity implications.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.81922912597656,
        336.63470458984375,
        152.7332305908203
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention acceptable to key stakeholders?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.66912841796875,
        526.8819580078125,
        176.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "Qualitative data from systematic reviews and end-user interviews suggest that TBSTs were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        179.16912841796875,
        526.9655151367188,
        192.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "perceived to have greater specificity and sensitivity than the TST. Having greater test accuracy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.66912841796875,
        526.9039306640625,
        207.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "was deemed desirable to avoid the negative consequences of false positives or negatives.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.16912841796875,
        526.9041137695312,
        223.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "However, TBSTs were expected to have many of the same limitations as skin tests in terms of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.66912841796875,
        526.8931274414062,
        238.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "patient experience (e.g. the need for a return visit, discomfort, a welt on the arm and stigma)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.16912841796875,
        526.9149780273438,
        254.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "compared with IGRAs. IGRAs were deemed the preferred test option in countries that already",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.66912841796875,
        526.5849609375,
        269.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "have IGRAs in use, because the required supporting infrastructure is already in place, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.16912841796875,
        526.9866333007812,
        285.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "because TBSTs would have comparable accuracy and performance, thus would not add value.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.66912841796875,
        527.0393676757812,
        300.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "There were also broader concerns about skin tests because these tests were viewed as a dated,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.983488082885742,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.16912841796875,
        527.0140380859375,
        316.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "basic technology that is subject to human error and interpretation. Suggestions for improving",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.66912841796875,
        526.9259643554688,
        331.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "the acceptability of TBSTs included careful communication during the implementation of this",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.1690979003906,
        527.1791381835938,
        347.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "test, with endorsement by health care providers and organizations (e.g. WHO). Data from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.6690979003906,
        526.6951904296875,
        362.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "the DCE found strong and consistent preferences among both health care providers and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.1690979003906,
        526.9590454101562,
        378.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "consumers for tests that minimize false positive and false negative results. The DCE also found",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.6690979003906,
        526.582275390625,
        393.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "that consumers had a strong preference for testing in the community and primary care settings",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.971914291381836,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.1690979003906,
        236.94207763671875,
        409.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "compared with hospital locations.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.3269958496094,
        290.5672302246094,
        433.2409973144531
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention feasible to implement?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.1769104003906,
        527.1065063476562,
        457.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "Findings from the qualitative evidence synthesis (reviews and end-user interviews) support the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.982986450195312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.6769104003906,
        527.0303344726562,
        472.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "feasibility of use of TBSTs, but only in settings where the TST is already in use, and the required",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.1769104003906,
        527.3424072265625,
        488.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "resourcing and training is already in place. TBST are likely to be low-cost, portable tests that can",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973567962646484,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.6769104003906,
        526.9679565429688,
        503.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "be well-suited for low-resource health care settings, which may not be able to support IGRAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.1768798828125,
        527.0142211914062,
        519.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "owing to the greater cost and resources required to implement IGRAs. However, if health care",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.6768798828125,
        526.990966796875,
        534.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "settings already have the necessary infrastructure in place to implement IGRAs, then that is a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.1768798828125,
        526.99072265625,
        550.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "more feasible test option than any skin tests because IGRAs do not require a return visit to read",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980181694030762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.6768798828125,
        526.6254272460938,
        565.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "the result (a step where patients may be lost to follow-up). Results from the DCE found that not",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.971012115478516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1768798828125,
        526.9656372070312,
        581.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "requiring an in-person follow-up appointment, or specialist staff or equipment to interpret or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.6768798828125,
        526.5955810546875,
        596.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "administer the test, were important preferences for TB testing that would influence feasibility.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995348930358887,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.1768798828125,
        527.0414428710938,
        612.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "There was some suggestion that providers preferred more expensive tests (when offered a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.6768798828125,
        526.9656372070312,
        627.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "choice based on a hypothetical cost of $50 compared with $25), although test cost was the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.1768798828125,
        280.68780517578125,
        643.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "least important determinant of test choice.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.6884765625,
        275.1541442871094,
        672.0684814453125
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.8193969726562,
        324.0604248046875,
        693.9644165039062
      ],
      "text": "Considerations for implementation were as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.5714111328125,
        78.81909942626953,
        713.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        700.5714111328125,
        527.0842895507812,
        713.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "regulatory approval from national regulatory authorities or other relevant bodies is required",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.967552185058594,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        716.0714111328125,
        327.8821716308594,
        729.2164306640625
      ],
      "text": "before implementation of in vivo diagnostic tests;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.5714111328125,
        78.81909942626953,
        744.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        731.5714111328125,
        527.2378540039062,
        744.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "appropriate communication on the new class of tests is necessary, highlighting the difference",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        747.0714111328125,
        222.2406005859375,
        760.2164306640625
      ],
      "text": "between the TST and TBSTs;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        762.5714111328125,
        78.81909942626953,
        775.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        762.5714111328125,
        313.90167236328125,
        775.7164306640625
      ],
      "text": "implementation of TBSTs requires a cold chain;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "138 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}